---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="Megan R. Kelley">
	<h1>Megan R. Kelley</h1>
	<h2>Welcome!</h2>
	<p>
		I currently work at the <a href="https://www.seti.org/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">SETI Institute</a>, where I am the Deputy Manager of the <a href="https://pds-rings.seti.org/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Ring-Moon Systems (RMS) Node</a> of NASA's archive for planetary science data, the <a href="https://pds.mcp.nasa.gov/portal/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Planetary Data System (PDS)</a>.
	</p>
	<p>
		Before working at the SETI Institute, I obtained my Ph.D. from the <a href="https://eps.ucsc.edu/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Earth and Planetary Sciences department at UC Santa Cruz</a>. My research projects focused on the magnetic history of the Moon, and my primary advisor was <a href="https://people.ucsc.edu/~igarrick/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Ian Garrick-Bethell</a>. Prior to that, I obtained my B.S. in Physics from UC Santa Barbara.
	</p>
	<p>
		In addition to my scientific interests, I also have an interest in data visualization and art; for samples of my work, you can visit the 'Portfolio' tab at top.
	</p>
	<p>
		<a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/meganseritan/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" aria-label="LinkedIn Profile" class="linkedin-icon">
		<svg role="img" viewBox="0 0 24 24" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="28" height="28" fill="currentColor">
		<title>LinkedIn</title>
		<path d="M20.447 20.452h-3.554v-5.569c0-1.328-.027-3.037-1.852-3.037-1.853 0-2.136 1.446-2.136 2.939v5.667H9.351V9h3.414v1.561h.046c.477-.9 1.637-1.85 3.37-1.85 3.601 0 4.267 2.37 4.267 5.455v6.286zM5.337 7.433c-1.144 0-2.063-.926-2.063-2.065 0-1.138.92-2.063 2.063-2.063 1.14 0 2.064.925 2.064 2.063 0 1.139-.925 2.065-2.064 2.065zm1.782 13.019H3.555V9h3.564v11.452zM22.225 0H1.771C.792 0 0 .774 0 1.729v20.542C0 23.227.792 24 1.771 24h20.451C23.2 24 24 23.227 24 22.271V1.729C24 .774 23.2 0 22.222 0h.003z"/>
		</svg>
		</a>
	</p>
	<figure>
		<img src="/campus-point-sunrise.jpg" alt="Photo of a sunrise over the ocean." width="700" />
		<figcaption><i>Sunrise at campus point at UC Santa Barbara.</i></figcaption>
	</figure>
</Layout>

<style>
    figure {
        margin: 0;
    }
    figure img {
        max-width: 100%;
        height: auto;
        display: block;
        margin: 0 auto;
    }
    figcaption {
        margin-top: 0.5rem;
        font-size: 0.9rem;
        color: #b8b8b8;
    }
	.linkedin-icon {
		display: inline-flex;
	}
	.linkedin-icon:hover {
		text-decoration: none;
		opacity: 0.7;
	}
</style>